GT patch 0031: GPU work counters and clear-mode rectangles as clears.
- GT_PERF_LOG: pipeline statistics per frame (primitives, fragment shader invocations as a multiple of the
  frame's pixels); GT_GPU_OVERDRAW=1: one query per draw, fragments summed by kind of draw every 5 s.
- A clear-mode rectangle (one axis-aligned rectangle of untransformed vertices whose edges land on whole target
  pixels, two non-degenerate triangles over its four corners, one colour and one z, all colour channels or none
  written) is done with vkCmdClearAttachments instead of a draw: same pixels, no fragment shader (GT clears depth
  this way every frame). GT_GPU_DRAW_CLEARS=1 draws them as before.

